MODULE: BaselineOnlyAfterRepairEnvironmentBanks
TARGET: BaselineOnlyAfterRepair
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: A subject change is incorrectly treated as a repaired baseline.
PERTURBS: Mutate
--- FIND
    /\ UNCHANGED <<phase, cursor, dirty, baseline, pendingBaseline, repaired,
                   probeOnly, pending, demand, servingDemand, sweeps, pump,
                   armNeeded, busy, selected, failureUsed, work>>
--- REPLACE
    \* MUTATION: subject writes cannot certify index reconciliation.
    /\ baseline' = [baseline EXCEPT ![t] = 1]
    /\ UNCHANGED <<phase, cursor, dirty, pendingBaseline, repaired,
                   probeOnly, pending, demand, servingDemand, sweeps, pump,
                   armNeeded, busy, selected, failureUsed, work>>
--- END
